          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Chantal",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Hail! The fledgling war-mage returns. Welcome, Delfador... and Deoran. Tell me, are the north-elves with us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Deepest apologies my Lord, but they are not. Lintanir—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("I see. Unfortunate, but ultimately of no consequence. Victory is nearly won even without their aid."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 10,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("See there: we’ve driven the Whitefang chieftain and the last of his guards into this old hill fort."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("The timing of your return couldn’t have been better, Delfador. General Lionel and my brother Arand will press them from the front, while you sneak in the back and roast their chief like a pig on a spit."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Without their chief the Whitefangs will dissolve into an infighting mass of petty squabbles, and our— Wesnoth’s victory will be complete!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "unlock_counterspell",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_89",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("Don’t rush the assault, Lionel — no need to waste good men. Take some time to stage our forces outside their walls, then attack just before the second dawn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Garard",
            text: _("We have them right where we want them. Once our forces are assembled, I shall join the battle personally and savor this victory up close."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I’m surprised the Whitefangs have been driven to the brink of defeat so quickly. Chantal speaks of them as numerous and cunning... I wonder if something is amiss."),
          },
        ],
      },
