              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("An orcish shaman! On occasion I’ve known some of the other clans to use their apprentices as warriors, but Clan Whitefang usually keeps theirs far from the frontline."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("What unusual magic! I don’t think I can tap into whatever fundamental forces she was using, but now that I have her equipment I’ll bet I could figure out how to imitate that draining attack... for our next battle, at least."),
          },
        ],
